        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive lower limb spasticity with genetic confirmation of biallelic pathogenic variants in GBA2",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires exclusion of other hereditary spastic paraplegias and neurodegenerative disorders."
